# Provenance for the files in this directory (mirrors dbarts's convention).
#
# role:
#   current - the baseline the C2/C3 distributional-equivalence gates
#             compare the WALNUTS fits against.
#   superseded - a former current, kept for the historical arc. Compare
#             against the current row instead, and read its notes first:
#             a superseded perf row may have been measured with different
#             harness settings, which makes some of its rows incomparable.
#   warmup-c0 - the walnuts-warmup C0 measurement baseline (bench-warmup.R):
#             per-iter sampling wall, ESS/sec, and mean leapfrog per transition
#             across the warmup grid; the ESS/sec floor and knee C1/C2 condition on.
#
# file                                 role     commit   build state                                    machine/arch   contents
